<p rendition="#indent-1">22. <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Paradisea</hi></hi></hi>. Paradisvogel (<hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">manuco-<lb/>
