<p rendition="#indent-1">29. <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Tvrdvs</hi></hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#aq">Rostrum tereti-cultratum:<lb/>
mandibula superiore apice deflexo, emar-<lb/>
ginato; faux ciliata</hi>.</p>
