<p rendition="#indent-2">2. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Coccothraustes</hi></hi>. der Kernbeißer, Kirsch-<lb/>
fink, Kirschknäpper. (Fr. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">le gros bec</hi></hi>. Engl.<lb/>
<pb n="177" facs="#f0199" xml:id="pb177_0001"/>
<hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">the hawfinck</hi></hi>.) <hi rendition="#aq">L. linea alarum alba, remi-<lb/>
gibus mediis apice rhombeis, rectricibus<lb/>
latere tenuiore baseos nigris</hi>.</p>
<p rendition="#l2em">Frisch <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. 4. <hi rendition="#aq">fig</hi>. 2. 3.</p>
