<pb n="178" facs="#f0200" xml:id="pb178_0001"/>
flauicanti-virens, remigibus primoribus an-<lb/>
tice luteis, rectricibus lateralibus quatuor<lb/>
basi luteis</hi>.</p>
<p rendition="#l2em">Frisch <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. 2. <hi rendition="#aq">fig</hi>. 3. 4.</p>
<p rendition="#l1em">Hin und wieder in Europa.</p>
<p rendition="#indent-1">32. <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Emberiza</hi></hi></hi>. Ammer. <hi rendition="#aq">Rostrum coni-<lb/>
