tibus: extimis duabus latere interiore ma-<lb/>
cula alba acuta</hi>.</p>
<p rendition="#l2em">Frisch <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. 5. <hi rendition="#aq">fig</hi>. 1. 2.</p>
