<p rendition="#indent-1">39. <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Hirvndo</hi></hi></hi>. Schwalbe. <hi rendition="#aq">Rostrum mi-<lb/>
nimum incuruum, subulatum, basi de-<lb/>
