Nürnb. 1758. gr. Fol.</p></note>.</p>
<pb n="233" facs="#f0255" xml:id="pb233_0001"/>
<p rendition="#indent-2">1. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Pipa</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#aq">R. corpore plano, rostro spathiformi,<lb/>
digitis anticis muticis quadridentatis, posti-<lb/>
cis vnguiculatis</hi>.</p>
<p rendition="#l2em"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">Seba</hi> vol</hi>. I. <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. 77.</p>
<p rendition="#l1em">In den Gewässern von Guiana. Wird durch<lb/>
