<p rendition="#indent-2">3. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Ocellata</hi></hi>. (Engl. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">the bull-frog</hi></hi>.) <hi rendition="#aq">R. auri-<lb/>
