<p rendition="#indent-2">4. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Paradoxa</hi></hi>. (<hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Rana piscis</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#aq">quorundam</hi>.) <hi rendition="#aq">R.<lb/>
