<p rendition="#indent-2">3. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Tinca</hi></hi>. die Schleihe. (Fr. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">la tanche</hi></hi>.<lb/>
