<p rendition="#indent-1">33. <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Gryllvs</hi></hi></hi>. Heuschrecke. (Fr. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">sauterelle</hi></hi>.<lb/>
