<p rendition="#indent-1">39. <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Aphis</hi></hi></hi>. Blattlaus, Neffe, Mehltau.<lb/>
(Fr. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">puceron</hi></hi>. Engl. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">plant louse</hi></hi>.) <hi rendition="#aq">Rostrum<lb/>
