<p rendition="#indent-1">61. <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Formica</hi></hi></hi>. Ameise, Emse. (Fr. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">fourmi</hi></hi>.<lb/>
