<p rendition="#indent-1">65. <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Tipvla</hi></hi></hi>. Schnacke. (Engl. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">crane-fly</hi></hi>.)<lb/>
