<p rendition="#indent-1">66. <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#k"><hi rendition="#aq">Mvsca</hi></hi></hi>. Fliege. (Fr. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">mouche</hi></hi>. Engl. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">fly</hi></hi>.)<lb/>
